  "objects": [
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-1",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 28,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "操作說明 · 全工具指南",
      "fontSize": 32
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-2",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 90,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 170,
      "zIndex": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "工具列預設為「圖示與文字」，常用分頁預先包含筆刷與線條樣式；可在自訂工具列調整。首次使用會加入「操作說明 · 全工具指南」無邊界筆記，涵蓋全部工具及可編輯範例。用中鍵拖曳／空白鍵加拖曳平移，滾輪縮放，開圖釘清單可跳到各章。舊範例與已編輯作品不會被覆寫；修改或刪除新指南後不會每次重建。 「清除本頁」預設收在常用；更新時只追加這一項，保留其他自訂常用。一般畫布與螢幕畫布的圖形選單使用相同描邊圖示與九宮格。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-3",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 272,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 260,
      "zIndex": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "01 介面與手冊語言 · 02 開始使用 · 03 首頁與作品庫 · 04 畫布格式與頁面 · 05 平移、縮放與視角鎖定 · 06 導覽與工具列 · 07 畫筆與筆刷 · 08 線段、箭頭、形狀與曲線 · 09 選取與物件變形 · 10 屬性、色彩與樣式 · 11 文字與便條紙 · 12 橡皮擦 · 13 尺規 · 14 圓規：準備、鎖定、畫弧 · 15 雷射筆 · 16 計算機與計時器 · 17 圖片、截圖與裁切 · 18 圖釘與配色 · 19 螢幕畫布 · 20 保存、資料與匯出 · 21 快捷鍵速查 · 22 程式更新 · 23 功能範圍與已知限制 · 24 背景設定操作要點 · 25 圖層順序與操作回饋",
      "fontSize": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-4",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 600,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 3,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "01 · 介面與手冊語言",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-5",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 662,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 4,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "首頁側欄下方「語言」（收合時為文/A圖示）提供正體中文（預設）、簡體中文、英文、日文、韓文、西班牙文、法文、德文、葡萄牙文（巴西）、阿拉伯文。保存成功立即套用，下次啟動沿用。既有作品名稱與文字不翻譯，新建的預設名稱採當時語言。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-6",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 784,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 5,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "使用說明隨目前介面語言開啟；本頁語言選單只切換手冊，不改程式偏好。全部手冊、章節與搜尋均可離線使用。阿拉伯文介面與手冊從右向左閱讀，畫布座標不鏡像。系統選檔與原始錯誤訊息可能使用其他語言，部分內建控制項可能需重新啟動。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-7",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 962,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 6,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "02 · 開始使用",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-8",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1024,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 7,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "首頁按＋新增，選筆記本、無邊界畫布或有邊界黑板，輸入名稱並設定背景色與樣式。畫筆用來手寫，選取工具（V）用來移動及調整物件。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-9",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1116,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 8,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "自動存檔預設關閉。Ctrl+S可手動保存，離開作品或正常退出也會保存。匯出.heiban可作為可編輯備份。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-10",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1264,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 9,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "03 · 首頁與作品庫",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-11",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1326,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 10,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "單擊卡片只反白，不顯示批次操作列；雙擊或右鍵「開啟作品」進入。右鍵亦可收藏、改名、副本與移到垃圾桶。垃圾桶保留原稿，雙擊垃圾桶卡片可還原。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-12",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1418,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 230,
      "zIndex": 11,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "按匯入旁虛線圓進入多選，圓圈打勾表示已選；可全選目前結果或逐張選取，再移到垃圾桶，「完成」離開多選。可搜尋名稱、篩選格式、依修改／建立／名稱排序及選160／190／250 pt縮圖。匯入支援.heiban／.blackboard.json；側欄切換全部、收藏與垃圾桶。 工具列預設為「圖示與文字」，常用分頁預先包含筆刷與線條樣式；可在自訂工具列調整。首次使用會加入「操作說明 · 全工具指南」無邊界筆記，涵蓋全部工具及可編輯範例。用中鍵拖曳／空白鍵加拖曳平移，滾輪縮放，開圖釘清單可跳到各章。舊範例與已編輯作品不會被覆寫；修改或刪除新指南後不會每次重建。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-13",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1716,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 12,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "04 · 畫布格式與頁面",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-14",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1778,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 13,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "筆記本各頁獨立，底部頁碼與左右箭頭翻頁，＋新增頁；頁碼選單可跳頁、改名、副本、排序及刪頁。無邊界畫布可向任意方向延伸。有邊界黑板提供固定紙張邊界，適合簡報與排版。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-15",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1870,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 14,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "無邊界不顯示尺寸。新有邊界黑板首次預設16:9簡報（1920×1080），仍可改A4直向、A4橫向或1:1；切換格式記住此對話框已選尺寸。新增與畫布背景提供空白、橫線、點狀、方格、五線譜及底色；既有作品按套用才修改，取消保留，修改可單步復原。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-16",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2048,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 15,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "05 · 平移、縮放與視角鎖定",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-17",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2110,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 16,
      "strokeColor": "#57816c",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "鎖定視角",
      "fontSize": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-18",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2172,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 17,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "滾輪以滑鼠位置縮放，Ctrl+滾輪亦同；水平滾輪平移，中鍵拖曳或空白鍵加左鍵拖曳平移。閱讀模式左鍵拖曳平移；倍率控制提供預設比例、適合內容及重設視角。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-19",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2264,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 18,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "視角鎖定停止平移與滾輪縮放，避免講解誤移。工具列與角落的鎖定指示同步變化，解鎖後可再次移動視野。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-20",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2412,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 19,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "06 · 導覽與工具列",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-21",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2474,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 20,
      "strokeColor": "#57816c",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "停靠位置",
      "fontSize": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-22",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2536,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 21,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "上方導覽包含首頁、閱讀／編輯、圖釘、＋插入、更多、存檔狀態及固定開關；未固定時滑鼠離開會收合。勾號表示已存，虛線圓表示待存、儲存中或尚未完成。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-23",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2628,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 22,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "拖工具列握把到四邊，上下橫排、左右直排。更多→自訂工具列可顯示、隱藏與排序，隱藏的項目仍在更多工具。「物件圖層」有工具列入口與獨立面板；螢幕工具列不顯示捲軸。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-24",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2720,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 170,
      "zIndex": 23,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "首頁設定或「更多 → 自訂工具列」可選只有圖示，或圖示與文字分頁。圖文模式分成常用、繪圖、插入、管理；選取（V）固定常駐。工具只排一行／一列，空間不足用兩端箭頭切換工具組，不增加工具排數。自訂視窗左側勾選顯示，另勾「常用」挑選常用分頁；仍可全選、預設及排序。所有應用程式內面板與對話框固定使用黑板的紙白／綠色設計，不隨 Windows 亮暗主題切換；系統檔案挑選器由 Windows 管理。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-25",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2902,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 170,
      "zIndex": 24,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "工具列預設為「圖示與文字」，常用分頁預先包含筆刷與線條樣式；可在自訂工具列調整。首次使用會加入「操作說明 · 全工具指南」無邊界筆記，涵蓋全部工具及可編輯範例。用中鍵拖曳／空白鍵加拖曳平移，滾輪縮放，開圖釘清單可跳到各章。舊範例與已編輯作品不會被覆寫；修改或刪除新指南後不會每次重建。 「清除本頁」預設收在常用；更新時只追加這一項，保留其他自訂常用。一般畫布與螢幕畫布的圖形選單使用相同描邊圖示與九宮格。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-26",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3140,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 25,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "07 · 畫筆與筆刷",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-27",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3202,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 26,
      "strokeColor": "#57816c",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "鋼筆 · 螢光筆 · 油漆筆刷 · 筆刷與物件設定 · 遮題膠帶",
      "fontSize": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-28",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3264,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 27,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "選畫筆，再點色圓調顏色、粗細、透明度及種類：向量筆、鋼筆、鉛筆、水彩、螢光筆、蠟筆、書法、油漆。偏好會保存；筆跡為平滑向量，筆刷名稱不代表物理材質模擬，完成後可移動或改色。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-TW-29",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3386,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 140,
      "zIndex": 28,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "向量筆近似直線，保持按住且停一秒可吸附直線，移動超過12 pt恢復原預覽；放開才提交一筆可復原操作。更多工具的遮題膠帶可遮住題目，雙擊或物件設定揭示／遮住，支援復原。 鋼筆、螢光筆及油漆筆刷完成後不會自動選取或顯示框線；按V再點選物件可移動、縮放或旋轉，雙擊才開詳細屬性。板擦保留左高右低，長邊縮短20%，厚度不變。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
